{"id": "y0441", "pool": "know-commonsense", "n_q_chunks": 8, "onset_chunk": 7, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "A stove is used to cook food, especially brown ing meat. It can also warm a room or provide heat depending on the type of stove and how it's being used.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 9, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "y0449", "pool": "know-commonsense", "n_q_chunks": 9, "onset_chunk": 8, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Beef stew is a classic non vegetarian soup that often contains potatoes as a key ingredient. So the answer is A, beef stew.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 10, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "y0457", "pool": "know-commonsense", "n_q_chunks": 7, "onset_chunk": 6, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "When energy that's built up inside you finally gets released, it often feels like a huge wave of relief. It can be incredibly satisfying, almost like reaching the peak of something you've been working towards. So while some might feel exhausted afterwards, many people describe it as wonderful or even like an o rgasmic rush of pure release.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 17, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "y0465", "pool": "know-commonsense", "n_q_chunks": 8, "onset_chunk": 7, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "When you fail to finish something, you failed at completing it. So the correct answer is C: completing.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 6, "carrier_ended": null}
